    {
      "id": "github:1131820351",
      "name": "ComposeYogi",
      "track": "open_source",
      "summary": "浏览器内运行的开源音乐制作应用：内置预制循环/采样库与模板，在时间线上拖拽编排多轨片段，可用 Stretch to BPM 把音频片段对齐工程速度，并导出 WAV/MP3/MIDI。MIT 许可，可自托管或使用官方站点。",
      "homepage": "https://composeyogi.com",
      "repository_url": "https://github.com/AppsYogi-com/ComposeYogi",
      "github_repository_id": 1131820351,
      "license": "MIT",
      "license_evidence_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/AppsYogi-com/ComposeYogi/license",
      "features": [
        "内置循环与采样素材库（public/samples/loops 下为按 BPM 命名的预制循环）",
        "多轨时间线，音频/MIDI/鼓轨片段拖拽编排",
        "Stretch to BPM：用适配控件把音频片段重采样到工程速度",
        "模板工程可直接改编，浏览器面板含 Templates/Samples",
        "WAV/MP3/MIDI/JSON 导出，本地优先自动保存"
      ],
      "deployment": [
        "官方站点 composeyogi.com 直接使用，无需安装",
        "Node.js 本地运行或 Docker 自托管（README 提供命令）"
      ],
      "technology_stack": [
        "Next.js 15",
        "TypeScript",
        "Tone.js / Web Audio",
        "Zustand",
        "IndexedDB"
      ],
